# PHPStan baseline.
#
# EMPTY, and meant to stay that way.
#
# It held 114 frozen `prosper202.directStmtCall` findings across seven files —
# direct $stmt->bind_param()/execute() calls that bypassed the checked
# Connection wrapper. All seven have been migrated, so there is nothing left
# to freeze.
#
# `reportUnmatchedIgnoredErrors: true` in phpstan.neon.dist keeps this honest:
# an entry whose findings are fixed fails the build until it is removed, so
# the file can only ever shrink. Adding an entry here to get a build green is
# the one thing this file must never be used for — a finding belongs fixed, or
# argued out in the ruleset, not parked.
parameters:
	ignoreErrors: []
